# Admin Assets

## JavaScript (`admin/js/edminboost-admin.js`)

- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`.
- Guard on `window.edminboostData` before running.
- Scope DOM queries to `.edminboost-wrap` or plugin-specific selectors.
- No jQuery unless WordPress already loads it for the screen.
- Use `DOMContentLoaded` for initialization.
- On `DOMContentLoaded`, set `data-edminboost-ready="true"` on `.edminboost-wrap`, then call all page inits.
- Page-specific init functions: `initOnboarding`, `initMapper`, `initBehavior`, `initPresets` — each no-ops if target elements are absent.

`edminboostData` shape:

```javascript
{
	version: string,
	currentPage: string,
	optionName: 'edminboost_settings',
	strings: {
		ready, configureItem, removeFromTopBar, emptyCanvas, exportSuccess
	}
}
```

## CSS (`admin/css/edminboost-admin.css`)

- Prefix all selectors with `.edminboost-` to avoid admin conflicts.
- Layout: `.edminboost-wrap`, `.edminboost-dashboard`, `.edminboost-card`, `.edminboost-status`.
- Dashboard: `.edminboost-feature-list`, `.edminboost-steps`.
- Settings form: `.edminboost-fieldset`, `.edminboost-checkbox-row`, `.edminboost-checkbox-grid`.
- Command Center: `.edminboost-cc-wrap`, `.edminboost-cc-nav`, `.edminboost-cc-hero`, `.edminboost-cc-footer`.
- Onboarding: `.edminboost-persona-grid`, `.edminboost-persona-card` (+ `.is-selected`).
- Mapper: `.edminboost-mapper-layout`, `.edminboost-discovered-list`, `.edminboost-topbar-canvas`, `.edminboost-topbar-item`, `.edminboost-item-drawer`.
- Presets: `.edminboost-preset-grid`, `.edminboost-preset-card`, `.edminboost-role-matrix`.
- Behavior: `.edminboost-badge-preview`.
- Status modifiers: `.is-active`, `.is-inactive`, `.is-selected`, `.is-dragging`, `.is-default`.
- Responsive: feature list stacks at `782px`; persona grid and mapper layout stack at `960px`.

## Partials (`admin/partials/`)

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `edminboost-admin-page.php` | Dashboard overview |
| `edminboost-settings-features.php` | Feature toggles (`render_features_field()`) |
| `edminboost-command-center-nav.php` | CC sub-navigation |
| `edminboost-onboarding-page.php` | Persona wizard |
| `edminboost-mapper-page.php` | Layout studio |
| `edminboost-presets-page.php` | Presets & role matrix |
| `edminboost-behavior-page.php` | Behavior & style controls |

Use `fieldset` + `legend` for grouped settings; label every input; `screen-reader-text` for icon-only controls.

## Enqueuing

`EDMINBOOST_Admin::enqueue_scripts()` / `enqueue_styles()` — only on plugin screens (`is_plugin_screen()`), version `EDMINBOOST_VERSION`. Handle: `edminboost-admin`.
